  "goodToKnow": "Der Untergrund is the ground beneath: the soil, or the surface you build or paint on (Der Untergrund muss trocken sein). It also means a hidden political or criminal scene: im Untergrund leben, in den Untergrund gehen (to go underground). Die U-Bahn is short for Untergrundbahn, though the word itself is rarely used. Don't confuse it with der Hintergrund, the background."
